This license covers the contents of this repository only. Artifacts downloaded
by `make bundle` carry their own terms, which travel with any box you build
from them:

  * Basemap tiles — OpenStreetMap data via Protomaps, under the Open Database
    License (ODbL). Attribution is required and is wired into the map UI.
    https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright
  * Census geography and estimates — US Census Bureau, public domain.
  * Model weights — per the model's own license (Qwen3 is Apache 2.0).
  * geo-agent, MapLibre GL JS, PMTiles, and the other vendored libraries —
    their respective licenses, preserved in the image snapshot.
